{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the median of these quiz scores: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7aed51adb61f4faeef0ed2948de25e51ca898e41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$95, 90, 85, 75, 88, 95$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"17\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/b/b2b265ec78ebaaebbd236b1eeeb78fd3e8e72f87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  80 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  85 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  88 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  89 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  95 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"430\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The quiz scores ordered from least to greatest are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/8/e389e3107396130e5db2c1d709a9dd0cf10ae345.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75, 85, 88, 90, 95, 95$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"17\" />. The two middle numbers are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/d/40d924a5d0ade21a3824a7f0343f8beae70ef96e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$88$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so the median is right in between those two numbers. Thus, the median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/1/a91c3991fc3cc73ed6b139cb5247839da8f6b649.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 89}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"67\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High S